{"seq":3,"slug":"policy-exceptions","title":"特殊品类与大促例外规则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-after-sales-center/policy-engine/policy-exceptions","wordCount":3103,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"特殊品类与大促例外规则\">特殊品类与大促例外规则</h1><p>如果售后政策只有一条「三十天内可退」，实现它只需要一行代码。真实政策由三层叠加构成：法定例外砍掉一批不可退的品类，平台规则在大促期放宽，卖家自愿加码让运费更友好。三层的方向、法律效力与冲突处理各不相同，把它们混在一个配置表里，很快就会得到「大促期间数字内容也能退」这种既违反法律又违反卖家协议的结果。</p>\n<p>本文处理例外的<strong>合成语义</strong>：当一个请求同时命中多条规则时，结论如何计算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-例外的三种方向与单向合成\">核心概念：例外的三种方向与单向合成</h2><p>例外规则本身有方向。<strong>收窄方向的例外</strong>（exclusion）移除一类请求的资格，典型是法定不可退品类。<strong>放宽方向的例外</strong>（grace）增加资格或延长期限，典型是大促窗口延长与会员特权。<strong>替换方向的例外</strong>（substitution）改变某个参数而不改变资格，典型是「大促期间退货运费由平台承担」。</p>\n<p>合成本文给出的核心规则是<strong>单向合成（monotonic composition）</strong>：在放宽与收窄之间，<strong>收窄只能由法定层发起，其余各层只能放宽</strong>。这条规则的收益是可以用一个单调函数表达合成结果：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-error\" title=\"ParseError: KaTeX parse error: Expected &#x27;EOF&#x27;, got &#x27;_&#x27; at position 32: …) = \\text{legal_̲allow}(r) \\ \\we…\" style=\"color:#cc0000\">\\text{allowed}(r) = \\text{legal_allow}(r) \\ \\wedge\\ \\bigl(\\text{platform_allow}(r) \\vee \\text{seller_allow}(r)\\bigr)</span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>window</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>legal</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>w</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>platform</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>w</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>seller</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>w</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>grace</mtext><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{window}(r) = \\max\\bigl(w*{\\text{legal}},\\ w*{\\text{platform}},\\ w*{\\text{seller}},\\ w*{\\text{grace}}\\bigr)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">window</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">legal</span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">platform</span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">seller</span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">grace</span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>shipping_bearer</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext>platform</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>seller</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>buyer</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow></munder><mtext>cost_rank</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{shipping\\_bearer}(r) = \\arg\\min_{b \\in \\{\\text{platform},\\text{seller},\\text{buyer}\\}} \\text{cost\\_rank}(b)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">shipping_bearer</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.716em;vertical-align:-0.966em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.309em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">{</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">platform</span></span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">seller</span></span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">buyer</span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.966em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cost_rank</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>第三个式子的语义是「取对买家最有利的承担方」。单向合成让系统具备一个极有价值的性质：<strong>放宽一条规则永远不会意外地让另一个买家失去资格</strong>，这消除了配置变更中最难排查的一类回归。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[请求的品类与场景] --&gt; B{法定层排除?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[deny&lt;br/&gt;不可被任何下层覆盖]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D[平台层判定]&#10;    D --&gt; E[卖家层判定]&#10;    E --&gt; F[场景层 override&lt;br/&gt;大促/会员/客服特批]&#10;    F --&gt; G{合成}&#10;    G --&gt; H[allowed = 任一非排除层放行]&#10;    G --&gt; I[window = 各层最大值]&#10;    G --&gt; J[bearer = 对买家最有利]&#10;    H --&gt; K[写入售后单&lt;br/&gt;记录命中的全部例外]&#10;    I --&gt; K&#10;    J --&gt; K\">graph TD\n    A[请求的品类与场景] --&gt; B{法定层排除?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[deny&lt;br/&gt;不可被任何下层覆盖]\n    B --&gt;|否| D[平台层判定]\n    D --&gt; E[卖家层判定]\n    E --&gt; F[场景层 override&lt;br/&gt;大促/会员/客服特批]\n    F --&gt; G{合成}\n    G --&gt; H[allowed = 任一非排除层放行]\n    G --&gt; I[window = 各层最大值]\n    G --&gt; J[bearer = 对买家最有利]\n    H --&gt; K[写入售后单&lt;br/&gt;记录命中的全部例外]\n    I --&gt; K\n    J --&gt; K</pre><h2 id=\"品类例外-从法定不可退到平台主动排除\">品类例外：从法定不可退到平台主动排除</h2><p>品类例外的第一层来自法律，前一篇已给出条款来源，这里关注落地方式。法定例外不能是「一个品类列表」，因为同一个 SKU 在不同状态下可否退回是不同的：欧洲撤回权下已拆封的音像制品与软件不适用撤回权，而<strong>未拆封</strong>的同一商品完全适用（来源：Directive 2011/83/EU Article 16(i)（已拆封的音像制品与软件）与 16(e)（已拆封的卫生用品），<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32011L0083）。\">https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32011L0083）。</a></p>\n<p>因此品类例外的正确建模是<strong>品类 × 状态的联合键</strong>，而不是单独一个 <code>category</code> 字段：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>品类</th>\n<th>状态条件</th>\n<th>法定/平台</th>\n<th>处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数字内容</td>\n<td>已开始交付且买家明示同意放弃</td>\n<td>法定例外</td>\n<td>拒绝撤回，按序处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>音像制品/软件</td>\n<td>已拆封</td>\n<td>法定例外</td>\n<td>拒绝撤回</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卫生用品/内衣</td>\n<td>已拆封</td>\n<td>法定例外</td>\n<td>拒绝撤回</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生鲜易腐</td>\n<td>不限定</td>\n<td>法定例外</td>\n<td>拒绝撤回，走质量索赔</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定制品</td>\n<td>已开始制作</td>\n<td>法定例外</td>\n<td>拒绝撤回</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>危险品/含电池</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>平台排除（物流合规）</td>\n<td>拒绝或因运输限制不可寄回</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大件家电</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>平台排除（逆向物流）</td>\n<td>拒绝，改为上门维修通道</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>后两行值得单独说明：它们不是法律要求，而是<strong>平台的物流与合规约束</strong>。危险品因运输限制无法逆向寄回，大件家电因逆向物流成本高于货值，这两类拒绝必须给出非法律的业务理由，并且在制度上要有替代方案——否则一次拒绝会把买家推向争议通道。大件家电的替代方案通常是维修上门，这条通道属于第二章的换货/维修单形态；危险品的替代方案通常是免退货退款（部分或全额），它不产生逆向物流成本，是成本上更优的选择。</p>\n<p><strong>免退货退款（refund without return）</strong> 是品类例外中最有价值的工具，值得单独强调。当退货的逆向物流成本超过商品残值时，让买家保留商品并退款的总成本低于安排退回。这个判断的前提是<strong>已知成本</strong>：需要退货运费估算、货值、以及该品类的二级市场残值。决策规则是一个简单的比较：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>return</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>C</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>ship</mtext><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>handle</mtext><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mtext>recover</mtext><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mtext>depreciation</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{return} \\iff C*{\\text{ship}} + C*{\\text{handle}} &lt; V\\_{\\text{recover}} \\cdot (1 - \\text{depreciation})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6391em;vertical-align:-0.024em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">return</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ship</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">handle</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9933em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">recover</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">depreciation</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>ship</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{ship}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ship</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 含运费与清关处置，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>handle</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{handle}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">handle</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是仓库处置成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>recover</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{recover}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recover</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是回收后可变现的价值。注意这个公式会随市场变化——同一件商品在跨境退回与本地退两种路径下的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>ship</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{ship}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ship</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 差别可能是数十倍，这正是第三章<a href=\"../cross-border-returns/local-return-overseas\">本地退 vs 退回原产国</a>要讨论的取舍。系统层面需要的是把估算值作为可查询的成本数据提供出来，而不是把阈值写死。</p>\n<h2 id=\"大促例外-时间窗-叠加与预算\">大促例外：时间窗、叠加与预算</h2><p>大促延长窗口是一个看起来简单、实现起来到处是坑的规则。</p>\n<p><strong>第一个坑是时间边界。</strong> 「大促期间下单的订单窗口延长」中的「期间」按哪个时间判定？按<strong>下单时间</strong>是唯一站得住的选择，因为买家在下单时无法预知大促结束日期与自己的签收日期，按下单时间判定才是买家可预期的。按签收时间判定会造成「同一活动相邻两天送达的两个订单享受不同窗口」，必然投诉。</p>\n<p><strong>第二个坑是叠加。</strong> 若一个订单同时命中「大促延长十四天」与「卖家自愿延长七天」，是取最大还是相加？单向合成给出的答案是<strong>取最大</strong>而非相加。理由是可预测性：相加会让窗口随命中规则数量增长，规则越多越不可解释，且容易在跨市场复制时出现「某个市场恰好只有一条规则命中」的不一致。若业务确实想要更强效果，正确做法是写一条明确的大促规则给出目标天数，而不是依赖叠加算术。</p>\n<p><strong>第三个坑是成本预算。</strong> 延长窗口不只是体验问题，它直接提高退货率与逆向物流成本。因此大促期的例外规则应当绑定一个<strong>预算与止损</strong>：预期退货增量、可接受的成本上限、以及达到上限时的熔断（暂停延长或收缩品类范围）。把预算做成规则的一部分而不是事后审计，是售后与财务协作的常态做法。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"rule &quot;peak-2026-window-extension&quot;&#10;  when  order.placed_at in [2026-11-20, 2026-12-05]&#10;        and market in cfg.peak_markets&#10;        and category not in cfg.legal_exclusions&#10;  then  window_days = max(window_days, 45)&#10;        shipping.bearer = platform&#10;        budget.cap = cfg.peak_return_budget&#10;        if budget.consumed &gt; budget.cap then allow = false, reason = &quot;budget_exhausted&quot;&#10;  priority 500   effective 2026-11-01 .. 2026-12-31\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>rule \"peak-2026-window-extension\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  when  order.placed_at in [2026-11-20, 2026-12-05]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        and market in cfg.peak_markets</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        and category not in cfg.legal_exclusions</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  then  window_days = max(window_days, 45)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        shipping.bearer = platform</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        budget.cap = cfg.peak_return_budget</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if budget.consumed > budget.cap then allow = false, reason = \"budget_exhausted\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  priority 500   effective 2026-11-01 .. 2026-12-31</span></span></code></pre></div><p>「达到预算上限后拒绝」这条熔断值得谨慎对待：它只应作用于<strong>放宽类</strong>的例外（大促延长本身是平台的主动让利），绝不能作用于法定权利。规则语言必须强制这一点——可以把 <code>budget</code> 约束在语法上限制为只能挂在非 <code>legal</code> 层的规则上，这样实现者无法误用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"卖家加码与平台底线校验\">卖家加码与平台底线校验</h2><p>卖家层规则是三层中最自由的，也是最需要校验的。允许卖家做的事应当是<strong>只在放宽方向</strong>的。可允许的增项包括延长窗口、承担退货运费、放宽商品完好标准、提供免退货退款、为客服提供一定的赔付额度授权。绝不允许的包括缩短法定窗口、删除法定披露项、对法定不可退清单之外的品类加排除、以及把退货运费强制转嫁给买家（在市场法规禁止的情形下）。</p>\n<p>底线校验必须在<strong>规则发布时</strong>执行，而不是在执行时。执行时校验的问题是「规则已经上线、买家已经看到」，此时拒绝一条规则会造成前台与后台不一致。发布时校验的要求是：给定新的卖家政策，能在法务基线上证明它不劣于底线，无法证明即拒绝发布，并给出具体违反的条款。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>卖家可配置项</th>\n<th>允许方向</th>\n<th>校验依据</th>\n<th>拒绝时的处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>退货窗口天数</td>\n<td>只能 ≥ 平台值与法定值</td>\n<td><code>max(legal, platform)</code></td>\n<td>拒绝发布，提示下限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退货运费承担</td>\n<td>只能不比默认更差</td>\n<td>市场运费法规</td>\n<td>拒绝发布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>品类排除</td>\n<td>不能排除法定可退品类</td>\n<td>法定撤回权适用清单</td>\n<td>拒绝发布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>先款后货/免退货退款</td>\n<td>允许</td>\n<td>无（放宽）</td>\n<td>允许</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>驳回理由文案</td>\n<td>不能含歧视性或误导性表述</td>\n<td>平台文案规范</td>\n<td>打回修改</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>除了发布时校验，还需要<strong>变更影响预警</strong>。一条卖家规则的收紧虽然被校验挡住，但一条平台规则的调整可能让数千个卖家政策从合规变成不合规。做法是政策引擎提供一个「假设变更」接口：给定一条候选规则变更，返回受影响的市场、品类、卖家政策数量与预计的判定翻转量。这个接口的存在让运营在改规则前就能看到代价，而不是改完之后从投诉量里发现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"例外与规则的合流-一份可复现的判定记录\">例外与规则的合流：一份可复现的判定记录</h2><p>所有例外最终都汇入前一篇描述的判定记录。这里补充例外引入的额外字段要求。</p>\n<p><strong>命中例外列表必须完整记录。</strong> 判定记录要包含本次求值命中的<strong>全部</strong>例外规则及其版本，而不只是最终胜出的那一条。理由是解释责任：买家看到「窗口四十五天」时，客服需要能说明这四十五天的来源是「大促规则的 45 天」而非「平台 30 天 + 卖家 15 天」（后者会导致下一次同一订单在没有卖家规则时突然变成三十天，从而引发新的投诉）。</p>\n<p><strong>预算与熔断状态要计入记录。</strong> 若某次拒绝的原因是预算耗尽，这个原因必须与「不符合政策」区分开来，因为它对应的处置完全不同：预算耗尽应当由运营决定是否临时增加额度，而不符合政策则是终局结论。</p>\n<p><strong>例外规则的退役要留痕。</strong> 大促规则有明确的有效期，过期后规则应当变成不可命中但<strong>不被删除</strong>，因为历史判定记录引用了它们。这形成一条展开前后一致的原则：<strong>判定记录引用的东西永不删除</strong>，只能标记退役。这条原则在合规审计中是关键——监管问询往往针对一两年前的某次判定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>例外有三种方向：收窄（法定专属）、放宽、替换参数；合成遵守<strong>单向合成</strong>，收窄只能由法定层发起。</li>\n<li>合成三个式子：资格为「法定允许 且 任一非排除层允许」，窗口取各层<strong>最大值</strong>（不加总），运费承担取<strong>对买家最有利</strong>的一方。</li>\n<li>品类例外必须建在<strong>品类 × 状态</strong>的联合键上；物流与合规型排除需要配套替代通道（维修上门、免退货退款）。</li>\n<li><strong>免退货退款</strong>的判定是一个成本不等式：退货运费加处置成本低于可回收残值时才安排退回。</li>\n<li>大促例外的三个坑：时间边界按<strong>下单时间</strong>、叠加取最大、预算与熔断；熔断只能作用于放宽类规则。</li>\n<li>卖家规则只允许放宽；底线校验在<strong>发布时</strong>执行，并提供「假设变更」影响预警。</li>\n<li>判定记录要完整记录全部命中例外、预算状态，且引用的规则只退役不删除。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三篇政策文档合起来给出了完整的输入侧：窗口与条件的建模方法、各市场的法定基线与硬约束、以及例外与叠加的合成语义。它们共同产出的判定记录是第二章的起点——<a href=\"../aftersales-order/aftersales-order-model\">退款/换货/维修售后单模型</a>会把这份判定变成一个可执行、可结算、可追溯的实体。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"特殊品类与大促例外规则","id":"特殊品类与大促例外规则"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：例外的三种方向与单向合成","id":"核心概念-例外的三种方向与单向合成"},{"level":2,"text":"品类例外：从法定不可退到平台主动排除","id":"品类例外-从法定不可退到平台主动排除"},{"level":2,"text":"大促例外：时间窗、叠加与预算","id":"大促例外-时间窗-叠加与预算"},{"level":2,"text":"卖家加码与平台底线校验","id":"卖家加码与平台底线校验"},{"level":2,"text":"例外与规则的合流：一份可复现的判定记录","id":"例外与规则的合流-一份可复现的判定记录"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"各市场消费者保护法差异","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-after-sales-center/policy-engine/consumer-law-variation"},"next":{"title":"退款/换货/维修售后单模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-after-sales-center/aftersales-order/aftersales-order-model"}}